<title>USA: Exporters sell 105,000 tonnes U.S. corn to unknown.</title>
<headline>Exporters sell 105,000 tonnes U.S. corn to unknown.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private exporters reported to U.S. Agriculture Department export sales of 105,000 tonnes of corn for delivery to unknown destinations during the 1996/97 marketing year.</p>
<p>The marketing year for corn began Sept 1.</p>
</text>
